---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const product = { title: 'HT Smoke — Smoke-Permeable Polymer Casing', image: '/images/ht-smoke.jpg' };
---
<SiteLayout lang="en" title="HT Smoke — Smoke-Permeable Polymer Casing | Haitu Casing" description="Smoke-permeable casing for semi-smoked and cooked-smoked sausage products.">
  <section class="page-intro product-detail-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/en/plastic-casings/">Plastic Casings</a> / Smoke-Permeable Casings</p>
    <h1>HT Smoke — Smoke-Permeable Polymer Casing</h1>
    <p>Smoke-permeable casing for semi-smoked and cooked-smoked sausage products.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section product-detail-layout">
    <div class="product-detail-image"><img src="/images/ht-smoke.jpg" alt="HT Smoke — Smoke-Permeable Polymer Casing product sample" /></div>
    <div class="product-detail-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Product Description</p>
      <h2>Designed around your processing needs</h2>
      <p>HT Smoke is a smoke-permeable polymer casing for sausage processors looking for smoke permeability alongside the mechanical properties described in the Haitu product catalog.</p>
      <h2>Application</h2>
      <p>Semi-smoked and cooked-smoked sausages, frankfurters, wieners, mini-sausages, and twisted products.</p>
      <a class="button button-red" href="/en/contact-us/">Request product details →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section product-detail-sections">
    <h2>Key Features</h2>
    <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>Controlled smoke permeability for traditional taste and aroma</li>
        <li>Lower moisture loss compared with many cellulose casings, as stated in the product catalog</li>
        <li>Good elasticity and mechanical strength for twisting and high-speed equipment</li>
        <li>Listed as in stable mass production</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Available Specifications</h2>
    <div class="spec-table-wrap"><table class="spec-table"><tbody>
        <tr><th>Flat width</th><td>30–120 mm</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Type</th><td>Smoke-permeable</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Color</th><td>Clear, smoke, and colored options</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Printing</th><td>Available</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Supply form</th><td>Mainly shirred; rolls also listed</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>
    <h2>Composition & Technical Information</h2>
    <p>The supplied product catalog does not specify the complete polymer composition or layer structure for this model. Please contact Haitu to confirm the current technical data sheet and any application-specific requirements.</p>
    <h2>Supply & Packaging</h2>
    <p>The supply forms listed for this model are shown in the specification table above. Please confirm shirring format, roll details, carton packing, and order quantity when requesting a quotation.</p>
    <div class="spec-note">Confirm the intended sausage type, caliber, color, printing and supply form with Haitu before quotation.</div>
  </section>
  <section class="cta"><div><h2>Need specifications or a quotation?</h2><p>Tell us your sausage type, target caliber, printing and packing requirements.</p></div><a class="button button-red" href="/en/contact-us/">Contact Haitu Casing →</a></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.product-detail-intro .eyebrow a { color: var(--red); }
.product-detail-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,0.9fr) minmax(0,1.1fr); gap:44px; align-items:start; max-width:1400px; }
.product-detail-image { background:#f8f8f6; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; }
.product-detail-image img { display:block; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; object-fit:cover; }
.product-detail-copy h2, .product-detail-sections h2 { color:var(--navy); margin:0 0 12px; font-size:clamp(23px,2.4vw,30px); }
.product-detail-copy h2:not(:first-of-type), .product-detail-sections h2:not(:first-child) { margin-top:32px; }
.product-detail-copy p, .product-detail-sections p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.75; }
.product-detail-copy .button { margin-top:10px; }
.product-detail-sections { padding-top:10px; max-width:1100px; }
.feature-list { padding-left:22px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; }
.spec-table-wrap { overflow-x:auto; margin:18px 0 28px; }
.spec-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; border:1px solid var(--line); }
.spec-table th, .spec-table td { padding:13px 16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); text-align:left; vertical-align:top; }
.spec-table th { width:32%; color:var(--navy); background:#f8f9fa; }
.spec-table td { color:var(--muted); }
@media(max-width:720px) { .product-detail-layout { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; } }
</style>
